            <div xml:id="m-40a8d608-2b0e-4f33-b8a1-019cd0e43b78">
              <lg xml:id="m-50bd4b99-4d8e-43f5-b071-f991b56b958c">
                <l xml:id="m-e9046813-1b5d-4171-97f8-b401a6a3b928" facs="#m-34dacc14-8cc1-4cb9-98f9-0e7dca3e4373" label="text-like">1094 Commemorations of the Sunday or of the Feria.</l><l xml:id="m-ae081621-dfb0-4823-8bc6-2cde6456fc6b" facs="#m-362f2362-8b60-41cb-9fbd-73693aaa0864" label="text-like">At Vesp.</l><l xml:id="m-ee0c5e07-33f1-4f35-8e2c-d0ebfedbc4dc" facs="#m-fb1290e0-fb74-453d-b378-bd491cbdb557" label="ambiguous">Ant. 5.</l><l xml:id="m-bb60e181-271e-4483-805c-22d9fe631035" facs="#m-77c7d220-b7e6-4d65-a8ef-331fa32a0475" label="lyrics-like">Olvi-te témplum hoc,“ dí-cit Dómi-nus: et post</l><l xml:id="m-968a4750-c1ac-4ec4-9bde-a4483216d077" facs="#m-5cf47d4d-5f05-485c-9eef-51f9f1a315d1" label="lyrics-like">trídu-um re-aedi-ficábo î-lud : hoc autem di-cébat de</l><l xml:id="m-85115cdb-8ab5-4047-9ba6-a4290aa11359" facs="#m-234dc2c1-5f23-4f95-9cb0-862f6e436352" label="lyrics-like">témplo córpo-ris sú-i.</l><l xml:id="m-3480d6a0-a3cb-4e1c-a84a-2f7c4294b761" facs="#m-96714d13-478c-4e90-9bbd-e40751a12e17" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-37f837b7-c41e-40e5-9274-d8ab6f63ec95" facs="#m-5ae7ce4b-d7e0-463b-8b5d-29b8b95d4bfe" label="lyrics-like">Eprecatiónem nostram, quaésu- afféctum, tribue defensiónis auxí¬</l><l xml:id="m-5c33c190-ae54-49c0-a9a0-32a2036d74d6" facs="#m-bb0162e0-e5cb-4c6c-81c0-635ee048fa10" label="lyrics-like">U mus Dómine, benignus exáu-lium. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-0e366e2d-e17c-4999-ae40-1b9db0448be6" facs="#m-87f4f4a4-f839-4fa8-84f1-a9bbcc2b8e49" label="lyrics-like">di :* et quibus supplicándi praestas</l><l xml:id="m-f00b3806-93a3-4ff5-94c5-5f84b933baa6" facs="#m-681f3d03-3784-4d8b-8f6a-53c19d408eab" label="ambiguous">Tuesday.</l><l xml:id="m-7096f53a-6cf7-416b-9a26-fafc6f710918" facs="#m-9b486812-c19a-44d6-8ba1-936d12b50135" label="text-like">At Lauds.</l><l xml:id="m-01ea7d3e-3ce8-4167-822c-91bb2cb8b702" facs="#m-0f3de567-1c53-481b-97de-f128a8fd6435" label="ambiguous">Ant. 7.</l><l xml:id="m-89ed6f6b-00f3-4f8b-aa43-569d1cd347e1" facs="#m-f71d17f0-f5b7-455b-9c18-c1add8536170" label="ambiguous">o</l><l xml:id="m-f620b0d0-4043-40c9-8511-4de5ac161935" facs="#m-b39fdca8-3bad-4502-b3ef-85a55826d6f4" label="lyrics-like">Uid me quaéri-tis “interfi-ce-re, hóminem qui</l><l xml:id="m-a3ca8149-230d-4c68-be00-7c65fabacfc0" facs="#m-fbf11614-bfa0-4433-8dd4-d981d6bd3fd6" label="lyrics-like">vé-ra lo-cú-tus sum vó-bis?</l><l xml:id="m-c1384468-a5b7-4a8e-ac37-9f3433e7315b" facs="#m-5ba8ed43-79b9-401d-b73b-16dfe050ce0d" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-1c9740b0-19ef-4325-ae57-7f470b25b3ce" facs="#m-5c845c92-1fa5-40bd-b0d1-6f2d94aeb170" label="lyrics-like">Acrae nobis, quaésumus Dómi-] et tuae propitiatiónis contínuum</l><l xml:id="m-0c9f5785-162e-46be-ae4e-a7cfac8cebd6" facs="#m-330ef0aa-1747-4f78-8b8c-3493a05e549d" label="lyrics-like">O ne, observatiònis jejúnia, t et</l><l xml:id="m-69f0d1c7-0253-48ca-951c-6e14ca7ccef2" facs="#m-fbcf626a-6e82-44ad-bc01-061c5ba8d872" label="lyrics-like">praestent auxflium. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-9119d3c2-9edb-4f8c-930b-39c854631af5" facs="#m-59ad1d5c-20e3-4f65-bbef-62093c42f6ec" label="lyrics-like">piae conversatiónis augméntum,</l><l xml:id="m-0670722d-1b10-4326-8cc7-65a0d33c70aa" facs="#m-1cc8d23a-dd3d-46b8-a130-3c191e4fe976" label="text-like">At vesp.</l><l xml:id="m-3619be10-6c80-4740-80a9-db5a87aff982" facs="#m-92ee8e0d-ce10-4cd2-9fac-7c53736d0644" label="ambiguous">Ant. 1.</l><l xml:id="m-31beb5af-5c33-40f9-9195-29ffaec23c32" facs="#m-e1029b45-a08b-407c-ac45-547afd46bbf0" label="ambiguous">n</l><l xml:id="m-b998df17-e9d6-4aff-afac-251aac80b986" facs="#m-baefc460-f0ea-4e36-ae31-67eba42000b6" label="lyrics-like">Emo in é-um“ mí-sit mánum: qui-a nondum</l><l xml:id="m-d359f627-e295-483f-85b9-0c6f407db5f3" facs="#m-3a8cb25c-2299-4fc0-ab25-b9b8d37fbaf7" label="lyrics-like">vénerat hó-ra é-jus.</l><l xml:id="m-6286d7d5-a697-4727-9450-95f57795d9fb" facs="#m-efa11ce0-331d-4f11-813b-c95b47561fc0" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-08f37a00-e208-4a86-ad40-276b5de340d5" facs="#m-545e5d11-4601-4283-a042-ee029c897a5e" label="lyrics-like">Iserére Dómine pópulo tuo :*] laborántem, propitius</l><l xml:id="m-e5a82aa9-651b-4d2c-a4db-4832b4abb332" facs="#m-0cb1282b-41a4-473b-94e0-be2a4f991f26" label="lyrics-like">respiráre</l><l xml:id="m-1496e076-0132-4308-b2c7-b6d57821101a" facs="#m-13dd36f7-885b-40cf-ba5e-73587441178d" label="lyrics-like">et continuis tribulatiónibus! concéde. Per Dóminum.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>